8","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"某","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"多个中的哪一个。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"(尊称)吃。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/223b4499b4897ecbcc78.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62822-1-9-2","ko":"밥 주세요.","zh":"请给我米饭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a0d3364d0002fff092d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62822","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":11,"sequenceScore":0.4117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请给我米饭。","裕敏，抬头看看天空吧。","您想吃米饭还是面包呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex